\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.2}{\ignorespaces What one strand holds after two derivative steps, for the winning strand of Figure~\ref {fig:frontier}. The bit-coded strand accumulates into a flat buffer; the tree-building strand accumulates a chain of heap-allocated closures, one link per step, each holding the next. Both are consumed exactly once, on the winning strand, at the end of the input.}}{65}{figure.6.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:strand-state}{{6.2}{65}{What one strand holds after two derivative steps, for the winning strand of Figure~\ref {fig:frontier}. The bit-coded strand accumulates into a flat buffer; the tree-building strand accumulates a chain of heap-allocated closures, one link per step, each holding the next. Both are consumed exactly once, on the winning strand, at the end of the input}{figure.6.2}{}}
